{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"a0f13d7bc9e24501","type":"group","x":-80,"y":-80,"width":1040,"height":760,"label":"1｜閱讀與捕捉","color":"4"},
		{"id":"b1e24c8da0f35612","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":380,"height":220,"color":"4","text":"# 閱讀時只做兩件事\n\n- 我學到／認同的：`#我的觀點`\n- 我不確定的：`#我的疑問`\n\n不要當下分類、建卡或找 MOC。讀完一段或暫停時，對 AI 說：**收成這一篇**。"},
		{"id":"c2d35e9fb1a46723","type":"file","x":460,"y":0,"width":420,"height":310,"file":"400_Atlas/閱讀停靠站.md","color":"4"},
		{"id":"d3e46fa0c2b57834","type":"text","x":0,"y":300,"width":380,"height":180,"color":"4","text":"## 要暫停時\n\n說：**停靠：這篇先到這裡**\n\n我會把來源、停留位置、未完想法與下次第一步寫進停靠站。下次先從停靠站回來，不必重新找脈絡。"},
		{"id":"e4f57ab1d3c68945","type":"group","x":1020,"y":-80,"width":1020,"height":760,"label":"2｜AI 澆水與我的理解","color":"5"},
		{"id":"f5068bc2e4d79a56","type":"file","x":1100,"y":0,"width":400,"height":300,"file":"400_Atlas/我的臨床知識工作台.base","color":"5"},
		{"id":"07179cd3f5e8ab67","type":"text","x":1560,"y":0,"width":400,"height":220,"color":"5","text":"# 收成後\n\nAI 補：來源、不同觀點、反例與缺口。\n\n你只需在卡內寫：\n\n**我的理解：……**\n\n然後說：**更新這張知識卡**。"},
		{"id":"1828ade406f9bc78","type":"file","x":1560,"y":290,"width":400,"height":300,"file":"400_Atlas/問題花園.base","color":"5"},
		{"id":"2939bef5170acd89","type":"group","x":2100,"y":-80,"width":920,"height":760,"label":"3｜形成我的知識網","color":"6"},
		{"id":"3a4ac0f6281bde90","type":"file","x":2180,"y":0,"width":380,"height":350,"file":"400_Atlas/Maps/我的臨床知識箱 MOC.md","color":"6"},
		{"id":"4b5bd107392cef01","type":"file","x":2620,"y":0,"width":320,"height":270,"file":"400_Atlas/Maps/臨床規則手札 MOC.md","color":"6"},
		{"id":"5c6ce2184a3df012","type":"text","x":2180,"y":420,"width":760,"height":150,"color":"6","text":"## 原則\n\n每一張經過澆水與自己理解的卡，都進臨床知識箱並連到主題 MOC。\n\n只有真正長成可操作的 if–then 判斷，才額外進規則手札。"}
	],
